## Validation Checklist (apply before returning)

* Exactly one `h1`; heading levels are sequential (`h2` under `h1`, `h3` under `h2`).
* No block nodes inside `paragraph` or `heading`.
* `list` contains only `listitem`; each `listitem` starts with a `paragraph`.
* `code` contains only `text`; no `format` array in code text.
* `image.src` is present; `altText` is meaningful.
* No empty `children`; no empty `text`.
* Adjacent `text` nodes with same `format` are merged.
